        "intro": "\ud83d\ude3aMy name is John.  I'm from The South of the USA.\n\u2b50I also study: \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439, Norsk, Gaeilge, Suomea, Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t, & Bahasa Indonesia.  Italki has limited the number of languages possible to show on a profile but I would like you to be able to know what I study, even the languages I am not yet fluent in, in case I can use my language experience to better teach you in my class!  : )\n\n\u2728Many people would describe me as a laid back and funny guy.  I work hard but don't make things too serious.  I believe in following a happy medium in all things: making classes not too lax and not too strict, being friendly while maintaining professionality, etc.",
